{"id":"57a61e79463767d7","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength.md","title":"Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength","display":"thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength — Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength","aliases":["27-thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength"],"display":"thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength — Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength","depends_on":["[[27-df-coalitionstrength]]","[[27-df-threshold]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§8.8 Theorem 8.43","source_statement":"Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength","source_printed_pages":"392","source_pdf_pages":"416","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength — Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"187c4495154fb991\" href=\"?note=187c4495154fb991\" title=\"27-df-coalitionstrength\">27-df-coalitionstrength</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.8 Theorem 8.43"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"57a61e79463767d7\" href=\"?note=57a61e79463767d7\" title=\"Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength\">Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength</a>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"392"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"416"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\">\\((w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S,T\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}\">\\(\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"187c4495154fb991\" href=\"?note=187c4495154fb991\" title=\"27-df-coalitionstrength\">27-df-coalitionstrength</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{i\\in S}w_i\\geq\\sum_{i\\in T}w_i\\Rightarrow S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sum_{i\\in S}w_i\\geq\\sum_{i\\in T}w_i\\Rightarrow S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n,\\qquad\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n,\\qquad\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>背景 x 在 S∪T 上为0，两次扩充的线性分数只相差两个权重总和；阈值判别保持其大小关系。任意两个实数总和必可比较，故得到完全单调。允许负权，不暗中假设正阈值函数；完全单调的逆向阈值性在一般维数不成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-coalitionstrength","status":"resolved","id":"187c4495154fb991","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-coalitionstrength]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength","status":"resolved","id":"57a61e79463767d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · source_statement","heading":"","excerpt":"[[Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$，$(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$；见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$S,T\\subseteq[n]$，$\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}$、$\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n$、$\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}$ 见 [[27-df-coalitionstrength]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-coalitionstrength","status":"resolved","id":"187c4495154fb991","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$，$(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$；见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$S,T\\subseteq[n]$，$\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}$、$\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n$、$\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}$ 见 [[27-df-coalitionstrength]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n","display":false},{"tex":"(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{i\\in S}w_i\\geq\\sum_{i\\in T}w_i\\Rightarrow S\\succeq_f^{\\mathcal P}T.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{CompleteMono}_n,\\qquad\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;(\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\subseteq\\mathrm{KMono}_{n,k}).","display":true}],"bytes":1678,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-79","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength|thm-thresholdcoalitionstrength — Threshold weights completely compare coalition strength]]"}],"outgoing":["187c4495154fb991","d0db491e5f6359f5"]}